WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:07.480
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.110
You know this is a trap. You could...

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:09.920
I know.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.020
Even so, I...

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.300
Eleanor believes in you. Yeah, even now.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.020
Of course, I do, too.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.790
That's why it's okay for you 
to believe in us, too.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.480
Electricity!

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.600
Are you all right?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.930
When the Reflection occurred,

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.620
we called those enveloped by 
the smoke "Darkness Reflected,"

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:52.690
and those enveloped by the 
light "Brightstar Reflected."

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.950
They were trying to kill me.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.950
Now that they have Eleanor, 
they've changed their policy.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.960
Lisa, let her go.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.710
She'll lead us to Eleanor.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:14.090
It's not about what Wraith is up to. 
Eleanor herself is the problem.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.370
I thank you for coming all this way.

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.870
There's no need to panic.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:07.820
There's no need to worry.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.620
I'm sure she will find her way to the master.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.260
Let us get ready for dinner.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.330
Where is he?

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.010
So that's where they are.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.530
So he's Wraith?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.810
I pale in comparison.

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:53.910
You're the one who called Vy here?

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:58.670
I simply relayed his message to her.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.110
It's a trap?

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.100
Let us show you proper hospitality.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:53.190
I'll make sure you have fun before you die.

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.600
This is your funeral banquet!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.180
Although nothing will be left of you.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:01.770
My flames will turn you five to ash!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.440
Lightning!

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.530
Eleanor?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.060
Eleanor!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.360
X-On, please!

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.400
Thank goodness!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.330
Where's everyone else? Are they okay?

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:55.320
Where... Where are they?

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.150
Just beyond here?

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:13.610
Wait...

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.320
Wait! Why?

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:48.480
Are you guys here?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.150
If you're here, answer me!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.910
I've been waiting for you, Eleanor.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.180
Who are you?

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:35.710
Wraith!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.800
<i>Ian, be careful.</i>

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:54.150
<i>Enemy Reflected are drawing near.</i>

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.750
<i>These are ultrasonic waves.</i>

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.750
The hell are you?

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.860
Wow, talk about a makeover.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:31.810
I won't let you interfere with 
our master any further.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.760
You're too late.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:44.600
I'm so glad that you finally found me.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:47.410
You searched for me so earnestly.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:50.570
No... I came for them.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.790
The thirty that you...

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:55.040
Are you sure about that?

00:12:56.140 --> 00:13:00.640
Through all these days that have passed, 
you were gazing at me.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.060
I think it was two mornings ago.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:13.590
There.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:18.190
I was just...

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.160
You're the enemy... Yeah.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:24.190
I was just trying to find out
more about the enemy boss!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.660
Enemy? Why am I your enemy?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:32.070
You were... kidnapping 
all those innocent people.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.100
Anyone with the Allen bloodline.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.540
But this caught my attention.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.910
A 28-year-old woman named 
Jennifer Allen disappeared.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.210
That's not all.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.700
Two days before,

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.970
her cousin May also disappeared.

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:50.760
I'm Michelle.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.850
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.980
Huh? Safe?

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.780
Mom!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.080
Maggie...

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.960
That's why you're my enemy!

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.630
So that makes me your enemy, huh?

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.060
Then you could also put it this way.

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:23.550
It's because X-On told you I was the enemy.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:32.420
Do you know what I planned to do 
with them after I took them?

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:33.990
Well...

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.050
You hadn't considered it, had you?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:41.560
I was merely gathering those 
affected by the Reflection...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.770
in other words, my comrades...

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.290
for their own sakes.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.860
Who gave you the right?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:52.940
It's also thanks to you that 
I was able to gather them all.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:54.940
What do you mean by that?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:15:01.170
Why do you think we were always 
one step ahead of you?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.670
And even though you were a step too late,

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:10.720
why do you think you were able to find them?

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.220
What are you trying to say?

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:17.470
We are connected.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.480
That's not true!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.230
You chose me.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.870
What are you...

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:28.200
Not X-On, but me.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.390
In the past, X-On betrayed his friends.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:41.040
In truth, he may never have actually 
had anyone he considered a friend.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.250
That's why he can betray 
them without hesitation.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.100
Why he can use them without hesitation.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.510
And that's why you abandoned X-On.

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:14.030
Everyone always lets you down.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:17.500
It's not just X-On.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.520
Weren't your parents the same?

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.830
Why are you bringing up my parents?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:29.210
I know that your parents also betrayed you.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:34.960
No... They didn't even care for 
you enough to betray you.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:37.810
Isn't that right?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:47.400
Why didn't you attempt 
to protect her earlier?

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.820
She was reaching out for you!

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:54.030
Why didn't you take her hand?!

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:03.430
Not bad. That black light's amazing.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:07.420
I had no idea they were making 
something like that.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.290
They?

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:15.550
I should have gotten rid of 
your friends much earlier.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.050
It was you?

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:21.060
Oh? I didn't tell you?

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:27.950
<i>Ian, what's the matter? 
Your energy levels are spiking.</i>

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.760
<i>Ian, calm down.</i>

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:31.160
<i>Cool down.</i>

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:35.070
<i>Ian, don't. You're exceeding 
the maximum output.</i>

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:41.430
But my master made me stronger, too!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.920
They never looked at you.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:59.100
They always looked past you... 
At your older brother.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:03.340
If he'd been born, he was supposed 
to have been named Ethan...

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.050
Your twin brother.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:07.440
Ethan?

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:11.920
You never existed in your parents' hearts.

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:15.080
Only your dead brother did.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.700
They never needed you.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:40.170
That's why you strayed from your parents.

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:45.080
You couldn't bear with the fact 
that your existence meant nothing.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.750
You were looking for help, weren't you?

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:54.240
You reached out your hand to cling to X-On.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:57.990
Why didn't you take her hand?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:32.290
I managed to lure him in, but...

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.610
Steel Ruler ended up in there, too.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.390
We'll just have to let our master handle it.

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:52.550
You poor thing...

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:56.210
X-On wouldn't take your hand.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.050
Stop.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.280
Do you know why?

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:05.710
That's right. Because you also 
meant nothing to X-On.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.310
Please...

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.650
But there is someone who needs you.

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:18.010
There's someone who knows that you matter.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:22.830
I did not kidnap those Reflected.

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.930
I took the hands they held out to me.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.910
Their existence matters.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:35.670
They are necessary fragments 
of something bigger.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.880
Fragments?

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:55.650
Eleanor, you understand now, don't you?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:59.980
You found me, and you chose me.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:04.060
I just wanted to be acknowledged.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.450
To know it was okay for me to be alive.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:12.450
I will take your hand.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.830
I need you.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:21.100
I need your existence for something greater...

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:23.470
For Darkness.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:25.320
Darkness?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:29.050
You must decide for yourself. Come.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:51.660
Eleanor...

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:56.670
You finally came.

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:02.170
What did you do to Eleanor?

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.170
She's dead.

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:11.330
It's all thanks to you. 
That's why I brought you here.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:16.520
I didn't expect you to come, as well.

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.310
What in the world...

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:19.520
Who...

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:42.770
Who are you?

00:22:44.720 --> 00:22:46.840
Ethan Everts.

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:51.940
Perhaps I'll look more familiar in this form.

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:10.280
Wraith...

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
White Sands

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
